  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">China Council for International Cooperation on Environment and        Development (CCICED) aims to provide strategic advice to the Chinese  government, and the goal is to promote a better global environment by supporting China&apos;s development towards sustainability. Conducted in   five-year phases with funding from China and a large number of        international donors. This support from Sida for 2012-2013.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">China Council for International Cooperation on Environment and        Development (CCICED)har till syfte att ge strategiska r&#xe5;d till den    kinesiska regeringen  och m&#xe5;let &#xe4;r att verka f&#xf6;r en b&#xe4;ttre milj&#xf6;      globalt genom att st&#xf6;dja Kinas utveckling mot h&#xe5;llbarhet. Genomf&#xf6;rs i fem&#xe5;riga faser med finansiering fr&#xe5;n Kina och ett stort antal         internationella givare. Detta st&#xf6;d fr&#xe5;n Sida g&#xe4;ller 2012-2013.</narrative>
  </description>
